@node Main "RadeonGL Help"

@{b}starter@{ub} -- online help.

This is a starter AmigaGuide help file. Replace this text with your own, and
add nodes for each topic. See @{" AmigaGuide format " link Format} for the
markup, or @docs/amigaguide-format.md in the project.

@{b}Contents@{ub}

    @{" Getting started       " link GettingStarted}
